Third-party components keep their own licenses:

- public/engine/ – Stockfish.js 18 (Stockfish), GNU GPL v3; see
  public/engine/COPYING.txt. Shipped unmodified and run as a separate program
  (a Web Worker spoken to over UCI).
- chess.js – BSD 2-Clause (installed from npm).
- three.js – MIT (installed from npm).
- public/words/enable.txt – the ENABLE word list, public domain.
- Chess pieces in src/games/chess/ui/pieces.ts – the Cburnett set by Colin M.L.
  Burnett, BSD 3-Clause; notice in that file.
- public/fonts/ – Inter, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (public/fonts/OFL-Inter.txt).
